        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses, together with the levitical priests, said to all the people of Israel, “Give me your attention, people of Israel, and listen to me. Today you have become the people of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so obey him and keep all his laws that I am giving you today.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
